Name: dunst
Description: Lightweight and customizable X11 notification daemon
Version: 1.12.2-1
Arch: x86_64
URL: https://github.com/dunst-project/dunst
License: See /usr/share/doc/dunst/copyright
Maintainer: arkanaOS Team
Dependencies:
  libcairo2
  libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0
  libnotify4
  libpango-1.0-0
  libpangocairo-1.0-0
  libwayland-client0
  libwayland-cursor0
  libxinerama
  libxrandr
  libxss1
  xdg-utils
Provides: dunst=/usr/bin/dunst, dunstctl=/usr/bin/dunstctl, dunstify=/usr/bin/dunstify
